hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"64","[AI-translation] Abbas bin Salim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ne Abu Sallam Habashi ko bulawa bheja, phir unhen [dak ke] ghode par laya gaya. Jab wo Umar bin Abdul Aziz ke paas aaye to kaha: Aye Amirul Momineen, beshak [dak ke] ghode par mera safar mujh par bhari hua. Umar ne kaha: Aye Abu Sallam, ham ne tumhen mashaqqat dena nahin chaha. Lekin mujhe tum se Sauban — jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aazad karda ghulam hain — ki hauz [Kausar] wali hadees pahunchi hai, to main ne chaha ke tum use mujhe barah-e-rast sunao. Abu Sallam ne kaha: Main ne Sauban — jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aazad karda ghulam hain — ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Beshak mera hauz [Adan se] Uman Al-Balqa tak [phaila hua] hai; us ka pani doodh se zyada safaid aur shehed se zyada meetha hai; us ke pyale aasman ke taron ki tadad mein hain. Jo us mein se ek ghoont piye wo us ke baad kabhi pyasa na hoga. Us par aane walon mein sab se pehle muhajireen mein se faqeer honge.' To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, wo kaun hain? Aap ne farmaya: 'Wo bikhre baalon wale, maile kapdon wale hain, jo aish mein pali khawateen se nikah nahin karte, aur un ke liye [badon ke] darwaze nahin khole jate.' Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Zaroor, Allah ki qasam, beshak mere liye [badon ke] darwaze khol diye gaye, aur main ne aish mein pali khawateen se nikah kiya: Fatimah bint Abdul Malik se. Siwae is ke ke Allah Taala mujh par rehem farmaye. Zaroor main apne sar mein tel nahin lagaunga yahan tak ke bikhre, aur apne jism se lagge kapde ko nahin dhounga yahan tak ke maila ho."
"65","[AI-translation] Abu Sallam Aswad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ne mujhe bulawa bheja. [Rawi ne] kaha: To main un ke paas aaya. Jab main dakhil hua to unhon ne mujh se kaha: Qareeb aao, qareeb aao — yahan tak ke qareeb tha ke mera ghutna un ke ghutne se lag jaye. Phir kaha: Mujhe Sauban ki Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hauz [Kausar] wali hadees bayan karo. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sauban ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hue suna, Aap ne farmaya: 'Mera hauz [Adan se] Uman tak [phaila hua] hai; shehed se zyada meetha aur doodh se zyada safaid hai; us ke pyale aasman ke taron ki tarah hain. Jo us mein se ek ghoont piye wo us ke baad kabhi pyasa na hoga. Aur mujh par aane walon mein sab se pehle muhajireen hain: bikhre baalon wale, maile kapdon wale, jin ke liye [badon ke] darwaze nahin khole jate, aur jo aish mein pali khawateen se nikah nahin karte; jo apne zimme ka sab kuch ada karte hain, aur apne haq ka sab kuch nahin lete.' To Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne kaha: Rahin aish mein pali khawateen to main ne Abdul Malik ki beti se nikah kiya. Aur rahe [badon ke] darwaze to mere liye khol diye gaye. Allah ki qasam, main zaroor apna sar bikhra karunga aur zaroor apna kapda maila karunga."
"66","[AI-translation] Abu Sallam Aswad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) tak ye [khabar] pahunchi ke wo Sauban se hauz [Kausar] wali hadees bayan karte hain. [Rawi ne] kaha: To unhon ne unhen bulawa bheja, phir unhen [dak ke] ghode par laya gaya. [Rawi ne] kaha: To Umar ne un se dardmande ki tarah kaha: Aye Abu Sallam, ham ne tumhen mashaqqat dena nahin chaha. Lekin mujhe tum se ek hadees pahunchi hai jo tum Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hauz [Kausar] ke bare mein bayan karte ho. To main ne chaha ke tum use mujhe barah-e-rast zubani sunao. Abu Sallam ne kaha: Main ne Sauban ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mera hauz [Adan se] Uman Al-Balqa tak [phaila hua] hai; doodh se zyada safaid aur shehed se zyada meetha hai; us ke pyale aasman ke taron ki tadad mein hain. Jo us mein se piye wo us ke baad kabhi pyasa na hoga. Aur us par aane walon mein sab se pehle muhajireen mein se faqeer honge: bikhre baalon wale, maile kapdon wale; wo aish mein pali khawateen se nikah nahin karte, aur un ke liye [badon ke] darwaze nahin khole jate.' Umar ne kaha: Lekin main ne aish mein pali khawateen se nikah kiya: Fatimah bint Abdul Malik se, aur mere liye [badon ke] darwaze khol diye gaye. To zaroor main apna sar nahin dhounga yahan tak ke bikhre, aur apna kapda nahin utarunga yahan tak ke maila ho."
